{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535600/extras/c060cdd0960a557745bb452c4e4fcd9c.avif?t=1752865393\" width=640 height=360 /></span><strong>A Father's Wrath. A Sister's Prophecy. A Child Lost to the Shadows.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the blood-soaked boots of Asbjorn, a fallen warrior consumed by vengeance, in <i>Berserker 2: The Saga of Hilde</i> \u2014 a brutal side-scrolling action game that blends cinematic storytelling, intense melee combat, and a haunting Nordic world torn by myth, sorrow, and violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a sequel. It\u2019s a reckoning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0Side-Scrolling Combat with a Twist:</strong><br>Explore a rich 2.5D world with dynamic 90\u00b0 camera turns that unveil new paths, perspectives, and ambushes.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535600/extras/62833a0a4067670515a9e3716a9356d8.poster.avif?t=1752865393\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535600/extras/62833a0a4067670515a9e3716a9356d8.webm?t=1752865393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535600/extras/62833a0a4067670515a9e3716a9356d8.mp4?t=1752865393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0Two Paths, One Bloodline:</strong><br>Play as Asbjorn, the wrathful berserker, and Volva, his sister-in-law and a gifted seer. Both are bound by loss, yet guided by different visions of fate.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535600/extras/b03d587bb29d6d5a781721a7ce08e3e1.poster.avif?t=1752865393\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535600/extras/b03d587bb29d6d5a781721a7ce08e3e1.webm?t=1752865393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535600/extras/b03d587bb29d6d5a781721a7ce08e3e1.mp4?t=1752865393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0Gritty Norse Atmosphere:</strong><br>From scorched villages to crumbling temples, the world is steeped in decay and forgotten faith. Every step forward uncovers more of the past \u2014 and the cost of revenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0No Mercy Combat:</strong><br>Master brutal melee mechanics, unlock berserker abilities, and battle foes that demand precision and aggression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0A Personal Journey:</strong><br>Driven by the loss of his wife and the abduction of his child, Asbjorn\u2019s path is one of violence, but also revelation. Some truths are buried deeper than the blade can reach.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3535600?t=1752865393","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535600/a67867294784910481261cf4ad61484f1f8c98aa/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752865393","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535600/de7ab6d92cfcfd4dd29da3ee4a578ee22a1b1fe4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752865393","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535600/de7ab6d92cfcfd4dd29da3ee4a578ee22a1b1fe4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752865393","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Berserker 2: The Saga of Hilde contains mature themes and intense depictions of violence, which may not be suitable for all players.\r\n\r\nViolence & Gore\r\nBrutal melee combat featuring blood and executions.\r\nEnemies can be slashed using melee weapons.\r\nCinematic sequences may include graphic depictions of combat injuries.\r\nDark Themes & Story Elements\r\nThe story revolves around revenge, loss, and survival in a harsh Viking world.\r\nTorture and suffering are depicted through environmental storytelling and cutscenes.\r\nMentions of ritualistic sacrifices and supernatural horrors inspired by Norse mythology.\r\nThe game explores psychological trauma and the descent into berserker rage.\r\nSexual & Sensitive Content\r\nNo explicit sexual acts are shown, but the game includes mature themes related to violence and suffering.\r\nNo depictions of sexual assault or non-consensual acts.\r\nSubstance Use\r\nAlcohol consumption is referenced as part of Viking culture, but not a gameplay mechanic."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535600/extras/c060cdd0960a557745bb452c4e4fcd9c.avif?t=1752865393\" width=640 height=360 /></span><strong>A Father's Wrath. A Sister's Prophecy. A Child Lost to the Shadows.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the blood-soaked boots of Asbjorn, a fallen warrior consumed by vengeance, in <i>Berserker 2: The Saga of Hilde</i> \u2014 a brutal side-scrolling action game that blends cinematic storytelling, intense melee combat, and a haunting Nordic world torn by myth, sorrow, and violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a sequel. It\u2019s a reckoning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragrap