t:</strong><br>Master brutal melee mechanics, unlock berserker abilities, and battle foes that demand precision and aggression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0A Personal Journey:</strong><br>Driven by the loss of his wife and the abduction of his child, Asbjorn\u2019s path is one of violence, but also revelation. Some truths are buried deeper than the blade can reach.</p></li></ul>","developers":["One Life Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535600/723023861e340decee330bd66198a518c4cfdab9/header.jpg?t=1752865393","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3535600/885389/92676211ca9d0ab859fcd5c36b7caeb3ebbde0bd/1750858926/dash_av1.mpd?t=1746819379","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3535600/885389/92676211ca9d0ab859fcd5c36b7caeb3ebbde0bd/1750858926/dash_h264.mpd?t=1746819379","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3535600/885389/92676211ca9d0ab859fcd5c36b7caeb3ebbde0bd/1750858926/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1746819379","id":257135722,"name":"Announcement trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257135722/46a9132acd249d5522068c69a34912665e7730f4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746819379"}],"name":"Berserker 2: The Saga of Hilde","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</stro